# Parameter definitions for thorn RaytracingXAST
# =====================================================

BOOLEAN reset_metric "whether to reset metric after RaytracingXAST changes it" STEERABLE = ALWAYS
{
} "yes"

SHARES: RaytracingX

USES BOOLEAN do_raytracing
USES BOOLEAN fast_light

SHARES: AnalyticalSpacetimeX

USES INT evolve_metric_every
USES INT move_every
USES INT resize_every
USES CCTK_REAL AST_t0